            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>This application discloses a secondary battery (5) and an apparatus containing the secondary batteries. The secondary battery (5) includes a positive electrode plate and a negative electrode plate, the positive electrode plate comprising a positive electrode current collector and a positive electrode film disposed on at least one surface of the positive electrode current collector and comprising a positive active material; the negative electrode plate comprising a negative electrode current collector and a negative electrode film disposed on at least one surface of the negative electrode current collector and comprising a negative electrode active material, wherein the positive active material comprises one or more of layered lithium transition metal oxides and modified compounds thereof, the negative electrode active material comprises artificial graphite and natural graphite, and the negative electrode plate satisfies 0.02≤I3R(012)/I2H(100)≤0.18.</p>
            </abstract>
